  - m_Id: 708215796703249
    m_Localized: Uncle Modou
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703250
    m_Localized: Hot bread, hot meat, happy customer!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703251
    m_Localized: Badara the Baye Fall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703252
    m_Localized: The Touba coffee is ready, the day can begin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703253
    m_Localized: Ndeye, Queen of the Night
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703254
    m_Localized: The night is young, so are the skewers!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703255
    m_Localized: Adja Fatou
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703256
    m_Localized: Sit down, eat, you're home here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703257
    m_Localized: Oustaz Grill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703258
    m_Localized: The charcoal is singing, good sign.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703259
    m_Localized: Aida Pastels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703260
    m_Localized: One for you, one for the road!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703261
    m_Localized: Mister Teranga
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703262
    m_Localized: Welcome, hospitality comes first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703263
    m_Localized: Mother Coumba the Caterer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703264
    m_Localized: Three hundred guests? The pots are ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703265
    m_Localized: Pape the Touba Coffee Man
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703266
    m_Localized: One cup and you'll run all the way to Rufisque!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703267
    m_Localized: Fatou Bissap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703268
    m_Localized: Ice-cold bissap to go with your sandwich!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703269
    m_Localized: Ousmane the Jakarta Rider
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703270
    m_Localized: Delivered before it cools down, promise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703271
    m_Localized: Yaye the Chef
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703272
    m_Localized: People talk about my thieb all the way to Saint-Louis.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703273
    m_Localized: The Car Rapide Driver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703274
    m_Localized: 'Last stop: Ndeye''s skewers!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703275
    m_Localized: Mame the Sandaga Trader
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703276
    m_Localized: The best price, for the best customer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703277
    m_Localized: King of the Arena
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703278
    m_Localized: After the fight, the whole neighbourhood eats here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703279
    m_Localized: The Great Griotte
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703280
    m_Localized: I sing your praises, and the whole street comes running.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703281
    m_Localized: Auntie Alloco
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703282
    m_Localized: Golden alloco, come and taste!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703283
    m_Localized: The Garba Boss
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703284
    m_Localized: This garba is the best in the area!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703285
    m_Localized: Mama Attieke
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703286
    m_Localized: Fresh attieke, nicely grilled fish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703287
    m_Localized: Mama Maquis
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703288
    m_Localized: Take a seat, the maquis is open!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703289
    m_Localized: The Choukouya King
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703290
    m_Localized: The meat is tender, the night is lovely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703291
    m_Localized: Uncle Tchapalo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703292
    m_Localized: A calabash to celebrate?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703293
    m_Localized: Auntie Kedjenou
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703294
    m_Localized: The clay pot has been simmering since morning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703295
    m_Localized: Mister Plateau
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703296
    m_Localized: Table reserved for the big bosses!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703297
    m_Localized: The Gbaka Driver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703298
    m_Localized: Adjame to Yopougon, garba included!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703299
    m_Localized: Aya the Juice Seller
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703300
    m_Localized: Ice-cold ginger juice, that wakes you up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703301
    m_Localized: Koffi the Delivery Man
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703302
    m_Localized: I know every street in Cocody.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703303
    m_Localized: Queen of the Maquis
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703304
    m_Localized: At my place you eat, you dance, you come back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703305
    m_Localized: The Zouglou Singer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703306
    m_Localized: A song for every customer!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703307
    m_Localized: Granny Woro-woro
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703308
    m_Localized: My taxi always stops at the best spots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703309
    m_Localized: The Coupe-Decale DJ
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703310
    m_Localized: The music is on, the street is partying!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703311
    m_Localized: The Star Footballer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703312
    m_Localized: After the match, everyone to the choukouya!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703313
    m_Localized: Grilled meat sandwich
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703314
    m_Localized: The cart grill sets up on the corner at dusk. Grilled meat is tucked
      into still-warm bread.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703315
    m_Localized: Marinate the meat with onion, garlic and pepper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703316
    m_Localized: Grill over charcoal, turning often.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703317
    m_Localized: Open the bread, add onions and mustard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703318
    m_Localized: Fill with meat and serve hot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703319
    m_Localized: Tangana omelette
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703320
    m_Localized: At the tangana, the omelette comes in bread to start the day right.
      Everyone has a favourite seasoning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703321
    m_Localized: Beat the eggs with salt and pepper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703322
    m_Localized: Fry onion and chili.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703323
    m_Localized: Cook the omelette on high heat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703324
    m_Localized: Serve in bread.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703325
    m_Localized: Spaghetti in bread
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703326
    m_Localized: Spaghetti in a sandwich surprises visitors and delights regulars.
      It is a street-breakfast classic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703327
    m_Localized: Cook the pasta.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703328
    m_Localized: Make a tomato-onion sauce.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703329
    m_Localized: Mix pasta and sauce.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703330
    m_Localized: Serve in bread.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703331
    m_Localized: Black-eyed peas
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703332
    m_Localized: Slow-cooked black-eyed peas are filling and cheap. They are often
      eaten with bread at the tangana.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703333
    m_Localized: Soak then cook the beans.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703334
    m_Localized: Make an onion-tomato sauce.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703335
    m_Localized: Simmer together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703336
    m_Localized: Serve with bread.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703337
    m_Localized: Tuna sandwich
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703338
    m_Localized: Quick and cheap, the tuna sandwich is the friend of rushed mornings.
      It often gets mayonnaise and chili.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703339
    m_Localized: Flake the tuna.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703340
    m_Localized: Add onion, mayonnaise and chili.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703341
    m_Localized: Fill the bread.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703342
    m_Localized: Macaroni
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703343
    m_Localized: Macaroni in sauce is another tangana star. It is sometimes served
      with an egg.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703344
    m_Localized: Cook the macaroni.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703345
    m_Localized: Make the onion-tomato sauce.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703346
    m_Localized: Mix and serve.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703347
    m_Localized: Green peas
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703348
    m_Localized: Peas in sauce fill the morning bread. A simple, warming dish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703349
    m_Localized: Fry onion and tomato.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703350
    m_Localized: Add the peas.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703351
    m_Localized: Simmer and serve in bread.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703352
    m_Localized: Skewers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703353
    m_Localized: At night, skewers grill under the maiga's light bulb. The smell
      draws the whole neighbourhood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703354
    m_Localized: Dice the meat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703355
    m_Localized: Marinate with spices and onion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703356
    m_Localized: Thread onto skewers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703357
    m_Localized: Grill over charcoal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703358
    m_Localized: Maiga fries
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703359
    m_Localized: Fries come with the evening skewers and omelette. Crispy, they go
      fast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703360
    m_Localized: Peel and cut the potatoes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703361
    m_Localized: Fry once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703362
    m_Localized: Fry again hotter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703363
    m_Localized: Salt and serve.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703364
    m_Localized: Thieboudienne
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703365
    m_Localized: Rice with fish and vegetables, thieboudienne is often called Senegal's
      national dish. The crispy rice from the bottom of the pot is a treat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703366
    m_Localized: Stuff the fish with parsley, garlic and chili paste.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703367
    m_Localized: Fry onion and tomato paste.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703368
    m_Localized: Cook fish and vegetables in the sauce.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703369
    m_Localized: Cook the rice in the broth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703370
    m_Localized: Serve the rice with fish and vegetables.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703371
    m_Localized: Yassa
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703372
    m_Localized: Yassa combines lemon and slow-cooked onions. It comes with chicken
      or fish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703373
    m_Localized: Marinate the chicken with lemon, onions and mustard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703374
    m_Localized: Grill the chicken.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703375
    m_Localized: Slow-cook the marinade onions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703376
    m_Localized: Simmer the chicken in the onions and serve with rice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703377
    m_Localized: Mafe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703378
    m_Localized: Mafe is a peanut-butter based sauce. It is loved across West Africa.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703379
    m_Localized: Brown the meat and onion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703380
    m_Localized: Add tomato and thinned peanut butter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703381
    m_Localized: Simmer with vegetables.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703382
    m_Localized: Serve with rice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703383
    m_Localized: Lamb dibi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703384
    m_Localized: At the dibiterie, grilled lamb is ordered by weight. It is shared
      with onions and mustard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703385
    m_Localized: Cut the lamb into pieces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703386
    m_Localized: Grill over charcoal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703387
    m_Localized: Season with salt and pepper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703388
    m_Localized: Serve with onions and mustard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703389
    m_Localized: Fatayas
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703390
    m_Localized: Fatayas are fried stuffed turnovers. They are eaten with a spicy
      tomato sauce.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703391
    m_Localized: Make a soft dough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703392
    m_Localized: Fill with meat or fish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703393
    m_Localized: Fold into a turnover.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703394
    m_Localized: Fry until golden.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703395
    m_Localized: Spring rolls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703396
    m_Localized: Spring rolls are part of party snacks in Senegal. They recall a
      history of cuisines meeting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703397
    m_Localized: Make the filling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703398
    m_Localized: Roll in the wrappers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703399
    m_Localized: Fry and serve hot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703400
    m_Localized: Pastels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703401
    m_Localized: Pastels are small fish turnovers. Parties are not complete without
      them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703402
    m_Localized: Flake the fish with onion and chili.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703403
    m_Localized: Fill small rounds of dough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703404
    m_Localized: Fry and serve with sauce.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703405
    m_Localized: Soupou kandja
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703406
    m_Localized: Soupou kandja is a much-loved okra sauce. It is served with white
      rice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703407
    m_Localized: Chop the okra.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703408
    m_Localized: Cook meat and fish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703409
    m_Localized: Add okra and palm oil.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703410
    m_Localized: Simmer and serve with rice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703411
    m_Localized: Caldou
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703412
    m_Localized: Caldou is fish cooked in a lemony broth. It is a light, fragrant
      dish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703413
    m_Localized: Fry onion and chili.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703414
    m_Localized: Add water and lemon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703415
    m_Localized: Poach the fish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703416
    m_Localized: Serve with rice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703417
    m_Localized: Thiakry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703418
    m_Localized: Thiakry is a millet couscous dessert with curdled milk. It is served
      chilled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703419
    m_Localized: Steam the millet couscous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703420
    m_Localized: Mix with curdled milk and sugar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703421
    m_Localized: Flavour and serve chilled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703422
    m_Localized: Millet couscous
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703423
    m_Localized: Thiere, millet couscous, accompanies many family celebrations. It
      is served with a meat sauce.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703424
    m_Localized: Steam the millet couscous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703425
    m_Localized: Make a meat sauce.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703426
    m_Localized: Serve together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703427
    m_Localized: Ngalakh
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703428
    m_Localized: Ngalakh is a millet dessert with peanut and baobab fruit. It is
      shared between neighbours during celebrations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703429
    m_Localized: Cook the millet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703430
    m_Localized: Make a peanut and baobab cream.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703431
    m_Localized: Mix and serve.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703432
    m_Localized: Roast lamb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703433
    m_Localized: Whole roast lamb is the king of big celebrations. A mechoui takes
      hours of patience.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703434
    m_Localized: Season the lamb.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703435
    m_Localized: Roast slowly over the fire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703436
    m_Localized: Baste regularly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703437
    m_Localized: Serve with onions and fries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 708215796703438
